            <tbody>
               <row>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Schema</b>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Key</b>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Type</b>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Input Value/</b>
                     <b>Description</b>
                  </entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>sensorId</entry>
                  <entry/>
                  <entry>string</entry>
                  <entry>Sensor ID.</entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>attached</entry>
                  <entry/>
                  <entry>string &lt;date-time&gt;</entry>
                  <entry>It will be “undefined” if the sensor is not attached to a motor; otherwise, the date and time it was attached to it.</entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>attachedBy</entry>
                  <entry/>
                  <entry>string</entry>
                  <entry>If the sensor is not attached to a motor, it will be “undefined;” otherwise, the principal (i.e., email) attached it to this motor.</entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry namest="c1" nameend="c4">attributes (Object Configuration): Motor ID and name.</entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry morerows="1"/>
                  <entry>motoriD</entry>
                  <entry>string</entry>
                  <entry>If the sensor is not attached to a motor, it will be undefined; otherwise, it will be the motor ID this sensor is attached to.</entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>motorName</entry>
                  <entry>string</entry>
                  <entry namest="c3" nameend="c4">It will be undefined if the sensor is not attached to a motor; otherwise, the motor tag or friendly name of the motor to which this sensor is attached.</entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>provisioned</entry>
                  <entry/>
                  <entry>string&lt;date-time&gt;</entry>
                  <entry>Date and time this sensor was provisioned.</entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>provisionedBy</entry>
                  <entry/>
                  <entry>string</entry>
                  <entry>Principal (i.e., email) who provisioned this sensor.</entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>lastConnected</entry>
                  <entry/>
                  <entry>string&lt;date-time&gt;</entry>
                  <entry>The value will be null if the sensor has never connected; otherwise, it will be the date and time this sensor last connected to the ADI OtoSense™ SMS Service.</entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>hardwareVersion</entry>
                  <entry/>
                  <entry>string</entry>
                  <entry>Version of the hardware.</entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>firmwareVersion</entry>
                  <entry/>
                  <entry>string</entry>
                  <entry>Current version of the firmware.</entry>
               </row>
            </tbody>
         </tgroup>
